  "qualification": "Full conformational and topological stationarity/decorrelation has not been established; slow topology is not proven fully decorrelated. Small downward conformational evolution persists in the 1M ensemble means: approximately 0.19% in Rg2 and 0.25% in center-terminal R2. r001 exhibits the largest conformational decrease, and residual initialization bias cannot be excluded. The final 500k giant-component decrease reverses within the final 250k in all three histories, but this does not prove global stationarity. Slow-shape sampling and block uncertainty remain limited. Some shifted comparisons of exchange rates show small coordinated changes. Only the three original histories are independent statistical replicates; zero-containing exploratory Student-t intervals do not establish stationarity. Historical E1 executable bytes were not independently reauthenticated; current E2 executable/build/source/log provenance authenticates. Rejected reaction opportunities and inter-diagnostic coordinates were not reconstructed. Permitted use is production initialization only for this exact system and these three absolute 4M endpoints; no production launch authorization.",
